{"4535300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "First Steps in Learning about Childbirth", "steam_appid": 4535300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;First Steps in Childbirth&quot; is an educational serious game that allows players to learn about the process of childbirth through an interactive story and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the onset of labor to delivery and the beginning of life with a newborn, players can experience each stage in a structured and engaging way. The game is designed to help users understand the roles of medical staff and the progression of childbirth in an accessible format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a sequel to &quot;First Steps in Pregnancy&quot; and is developed with the cooperation of medical professionals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Story-based experience covering the full childbirth journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interactive mini-games simulating key moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Educational TIPS explaining important concepts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quiz-style learning elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Designed for beginners, families, and healthcare students</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is intended for educational purposes only and does not provide medical advice. For actual medical decisions, please consult a qualified healthcare professional.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;First Steps in Childbirth&quot; is an educational serious game that allows players to learn about the process of childbirth through an interactive story and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the onset of labor to delivery and the beginning of life with a newborn, players can experience each stage in a structured and engaging way. The game is designed to help users understand the roles of medical staff and the progression of c